    <description>RETIRED 2026-08-16. Built to replace AF_FL_Lead_SLAEscalation&apos;s scheduled paths on suspicion they caused RECORD_IN_USE_BY_WORKFLOW blocking Lead Convert. That suspicion was NOT confirmed: after this flow was deployed and AF_FL_Lead_SLAEscalation&apos;s scheduled paths were fully removed, a brand-new Lead still failed to convert with the identical error — ruling out scheduled paths (and this flow&apos;s premise) as the actual cause. AF_FL_Lead_SLAEscalation&apos;s original 3-tier real-time design was restored. Kept only for history; do not reactivate without first re-confirming this is genuinely needed, since real-world Lead Convert testing never actually confirmed scheduled paths were the culprit.</description>
